(: Everyday words for the body (

    I am not a medical doctor. I do not know medicine. I do not know what anterior or posterior means and I do not want to know. Do not use anatomical words like Lumen, just say what it is. Avoid all latiny greekish whatever words used to describe these things, and don't use medical jargon where normal words work just as well, as this shows true mastery.

) End Everyday words for the body :) With gratitude for this reading
